{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12903","headline":"送齐明府赴东阳 · 韩翃","name":"送齐明府赴东阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿丝帆繂桂爲樯，过尽淮山楚水长。\n万里移家背春谷，一官行府向东阳。\n风流好爱杯中物，豪荡仍欺陌上郎。\n别後心期如在眼，猨声烟色树苍苍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}